This project depends on l5kit (https://github.com/woven-by-toyota/l5kit),
licensed under the Apache License 2.0. l5kit is installed at setup time and
patched by scripts/patch_l5kit.py: a small numpy-compatibility fix, and a
replacement for its generated protobuf module. That replacement,
third_party/l5kit/road_network_pb2.py, is protoc output generated from
l5kit's road_network.proto (v1.5.0) and is the only l5kit-derived file
redistributed in this repository.

The experiments consume the Lyft Level 5 Prediction dataset, which is
licensed CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 by its authors and is not redistributed in this
repository in any form.
